#82000
"An Icy Trail - Between Towering Drifts"
"The snow at your feet has been packed down by the passage of countless large

creatures; their footprints are visible moving from the highest point here

down a slope towards the north.  Drifts rise to thirty feet on either side of

you here, blocking sight and sound and making travel in those directions

impossible.  Large snowdrifts have collected below you to the south, but these

drifts are probably passable, if with a little digging.

"
"[Nereus] This room must not be no.mob so yeti can wander in and out without

providing players with a \"safe room\" to go to so they can run yeti more safely.

"
