#82001
"An Icy Trail - Between Towering Drifts"
"An icy trail is evident here, marked by giant humanoid footprints.  To the

north and south, the trail follows a rise; this section of the trail is in a

muted depression that is thankfully free of the wind.  Great drifts loom

menacingly on both sides of the trail, fifty feet of ice and snow that could

come crashing down on your head given the slightest disturbance in the area.

"
