#82003
"Wide Trail Under Overhang"
"A wide trail has been worn down to gray rock along the base of the overhanging

mountain above.  Snow blows from above and collects in drifts to the west and

along a snowbank before a sheer drop into yawning white north of the trail. 

Patches of ice cover the edges of the trail, packed down by large humanoid

creatures moving through the area.  The trail continues to hug the cliffside

and slopes down to the east.

"
