#82008
"Ice-slicked Path - Between Mountain and Chasm"
"Perhaps at one time the name \"Dragonspire Pass\" was more appropriate, but here

the trail narrows to a mere handspan in places.  Scoured by a biting wind, no

snow clings to the rock along this section of the trail; it has been replaced

with a thin coating of nearly invisible ice.  An icy chasm falls away below

the cliff's edge to the west, its bottom lost in a swirl of dusty snow.

"
"[Nereus] Fall here

"
