#82019
"Inside a Great Nest - Sheltered From the Storm"
"Towering hundreds of feet above the trail, a large and sturdy nest has been

constructed between two mountain peaks.  However, no ordinary bird or beast

built this nest; it has been piled with entire trees ripped straight from the

earth and dropped into the gap between the peaks.  It is sheltered from the

storm here, since the eastern peak overhangs the nest, although in all other

directions you can see for miles.  The nest has a thin layer of mud, ice, and

small feathers at the bottom, providing a not terribly comfortable but

workable place to rest.

"
"[Nereus] Do not remove or reorder acode 1 here.

[Maurtock] make eggs breakable/edible

"
