"Ice-Rimed Chasm"
"The chasm is nearly ten meters across at the bottom in this wider section. 

Nearly perpendicular to the chasm floor, the walls of the chasm loom above you

for hundreds of feet, the top of the cliff lost above in the falling snow. 

