portal to the east is a stone chamber of the same charcoal-grey stone of the

tunnel you stand in, while to the west, the chamber appears to be completely

constructed of ice.  To the north, there is an abrupt line where the deep grey

stone ends; whether the magic has failed beyond this point or the builders

simply used a different material beyond is unknown.

