construction of this crypt of ice.  The floor is perfectly smooth, opaque ice,

lacking any blemish or imperfection.  The walls and ceiling are at remarkably

straight right angles from one another and in equally pristine condition.  A

pair of cylindrical columns of faintly lit ice stand in the center of the

room, a coffin of crystalline ice between them.

